@{
    Layout = "_Layout";
}
@section Styles {
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/AboutUs.css?v=@(DateTime.Now.Ticks)" asp-append-version="true" />
}

<section class="heritage-hero">
    <h1>THE HANDS BEHIND ASHOK JEWELLERY</h1>
    <p>A Legacy Built on Love & Trust Since 1985</p>
</section>

<div class="legacy-container">
    
    <section class="profile-row">
        <div class="profile-image">
            <div class="circle-frame">
                <img src="~/images/fatherimg3.png" alt="Shri Ashok Vitonde">
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="profile-text">
            <h2 class="gold-title">The Foundation: A Vision of Hard Work</h2>
            <h3>The Visionary: Shri Ashok Vitonde</h3>
            <p>Our story began with a single dream and the tireless hands of our founder, <strong>Shri Ashok Vitonde</strong>. He started this journey from the very ground up. To him, jewellery was never just a trade—it was a calling.</p>
            <p>He possessed an innate talent for understanding the language of gold and the brilliance of gemstones. He built Ashok Jewellery Art fueled by a relentless passion to create masterpieces that become part of people's most cherished memories.</p>
            
            <p class="emotional-quote">"The honesty of hard work he taught us still reflects in each of our designs today."</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="profile-row reverse-row">
        <div class="profile-text">
            <h2 class="gold-title">The New Era: Honoring the Promise</h2>
            <h3>Managing Director: Gaurav Vitonde</h3>
            <p>Since 2019, the mantle has been carried forward by his son, <strong>Gaurav Vitonde (MBA)</strong>. With the discipline of a modern businessman and the soul of a craftsman, he manages the legacy with a focus on trust.</p>
            <p>In an industry where purity is everything, he ensures that every customer feels the same warmth and honesty that our father provided for decades. Our brother manages the business with integrity, ensuring no trust is ever broken.</p>
            <p class="emotional-quote-bro">
                "Walking in our father's footsteps, he doesn't just manage a brand; he preserves a sacred tradition of trust for the next generation."
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="profile-image">
            <div class="circle-frame">
                <img src="~/images/sonimg4.png" alt="Gaurav Vitonde">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="legacy-box-section">
        <div class="legacy-rectangle-new-shape">
            <div class="legacy-item">
                <h3>A Legacy of Artistry and Integrity</h3>
                <p>
                    He dedicated his life to the pursuit of perfection, believing that a jeweler’s true craft lies in winning a customer's heart.
                    To him, every piece that left the showroom was a testament to his personal honor. He didn't just build a business;
                    he built a legacy of trust that stood the test of time, ensuring that <strong>"Ashok Jewellery Art"</strong>
                    became a name synonymous with purity and excellence.
                </p>
            </div>
        
            <div class="legacy-divider"></div>

            <div class="legacy-item">
                <h3>The Foundation of Excellence</h3>
                <p>
                    His unwavering work ethic and success became the guiding light for his children. Inspired by his discipline,
                    the next generation has grown to achieve professional excellence in diverse fields—from Medicine to Technology
                    and Management. This multi-disciplinary background now brings a unique strength to the brand,
                    blending traditional artistry with modern professional standards.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="family-trust-banner">
        <div class="trust-box-rectangle">
            <h2 class="gold-title">A Legacy of Excellence & Education</h2>
            <p class="trust-text">
                "At Ashok Jewellery Art , our legacy is defined by a unique blendof traditional trust and modern professional standards. We take pride in being a family of professionals who apply the same rigor and ethics to our craft as we do to our diverse academic backgrounds."
            </p>
            <div class="trust-divider"></div>
            <p class="trust-subtext">
                "This multi-disciplinary background ensures that every masterpiece we create is backed by academic precision, modern innovation, and an unwavering commitment to honesty."
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="core-values-section" id="values-section">
        <div class="ourvalue-container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Our Core Values</h2>
            <div class="values-grid">
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon">⭐</div>
                    <h3>100% Purity</h3>
                    <p>Every piece is BIS Hallmarked, ensuring the highest standards of gold purity.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon">🤝</div>
                    <h3>Transparency</h3>
                    <p>Fair pricing with no hidden making charges. Trust is our biggest asset.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon">🎨</div>
                    <h3>Artistry</h3>
                    <p>Blending traditional hand-carving techniques with modern design aesthetics.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="journey-timeline">
        <div class="jrny-container">
            <h2 class="section-title">The Journey</h2>
            <div class="timeline-wrapper">
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <span class="year">1985</span>
                    <p>Ashok Jewellery Art was founded with a small workshop and big dreams.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-arrow">→</div>
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <span class="year">2019</span>
                    <p>Gaurav Vitonde joined, bringing professional management and innovation.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-arrow">→</div>
                <div class="timeline-item active">
                    <span class="year">Today</span>
                    <p>A leading name in premium jewellery, trusted by thousands of families.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="signature-collections">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Our Signature Masterpieces</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle">A glimpse into our finest handcrafted creations.</p>
        
            <div class="collections-grid">
                <div class="collection-item">
                    <div class="collection-img-wrapper">
                        <img src="~/images/signatureimg1.png" alt="Bridal Collection">
                    </div>
                    <h4>The Royal Bridal Suite</h4>
                </div>
                <div class="collection-item">
                    <div class="collection-img-wrapper">
                        <img src="~/images/signatureimg2.png" alt="Diamond Rings">
                    </div>
                    <h4>Ethereal Diamond Bands</h4>
                </div>
                <div class="collection-item">
                    <div class="collection-img-wrapper">
                        <img src="~/images/signatureimg3.png" alt="Antique Gold">
                    </div>
                    <h4>Heritage Antique Gold</h4>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="aj-trust-section" id="hallmarking-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="aj-assurance-frame">
            
                <div class="aj-section-header">
                    <h2 class="aj-main-title">The Hallmark of Trust</h2>
                    <p class="aj-sub-title">Every masterpiece at Ashok Jewellery Art is a promise of purity.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="premium-badges-wrapper">
                    <div class="premium-badge-card">
                        <div class="badge-shape-outer">
                            <div class="badge-shape-inner">
                                <img src="/images/BISlogo12.png" alt="BIS Hallmark">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="badge-content">
                            <h4>BIS Hallmarked</h4>
                            <p>Assuring 100% purity in every gram of gold.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="premium-badge-card">
                        <div class="badge-shape-outer">
                            <div class="badge-shape-inner">
                                <img src="/images/IGIlogo2.png" alt="IGI Certified">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="badge-content">
                            <h4>IGI Certified</h4>
                            <p>International certification for diamonds.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="premium-badge-card">
                        <div class="badge-shape-outer">
                            <div class="badge-shape-inner">
                                <img src="/images/SECUREPAYIMG7.jpg" alt="Secure Payment">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="badge-content">
                            <h4>Secure Purchase</h4>
                            <p>Safe transactions with 100% encryption.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>
<a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index" class="floating-home-btn" title="Back to Home">
    <svg class="home-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
        <path d="M11.47 3.84a.75.75 0 011.06 0l8.69 8.69a.75.75 0 11-1.06 1.06l-.97-.97v7.13c0 .966-.784 1.75-1.75 1.75H15.5a.75.75 0 01-.75-.75v-4.5a.75.75 0 00-.75-.75h-2a.75.75 0 00-.75.75v4.5a.75.75 0 01-.75.75H6.25A1.75 1.75 0 014.5 19.75v-7.13l-.97.97a.75.75 0 01-1.06-1.06l8.69-8.69z" />
    </svg>
    <span>Home</span>
</a>
